off_cbytes = 24.

frame_len = 87 + 1 + 24 + 35 = 147.

offset[0] = frame_len - header_len = 147 - 87 = 60.

Let me verify: `header_len + offset + 16 = 87 + 60 + 16 = 163 > 147 = frame_len`. Yes!

And `offset (60) <= frame_len (147)`. Yes.

